    "sections": {
        "description": "Neonio is a professional WordPress theme built for creators and studios who need a clean, high-performing portfolio presence. It is engineered around a focused set of well-considered features rather than bloat, giving you a fast, reliable foundation to build a serious online presence on. The theme is built entirely on WordPress's native architecture, using the Customizer for theme options and Gutenberg for content creation. This means no proprietary page builders, no unnecessary dependencies, and no lock-in — just a clean integration that stays maintainable and compatible as WordPress evolves. Core capabilities include AJAX-powered post loading, refined typography controls, and flexible layout options, all tuned for speed, usability, and accessibility. For teams and creators who need more, the Neonio Premium Plugin extends the theme with a dedicated Portfolio custom post type, additional Gutenberg blocks, and expanded Customizer options."
    },
